> API and interpretation

Requested counts are nonnegative and bounded separately from actual work and
captured state values. Defaults allow4096 fractional digits, with an
intrinsic100000 cap protecting small-column arithmetic. The decimal point is
retained even for zero digits. Frequencies intentionally count the leading2,
correcting the old400-digit wording:400 fractional digits give401 counted
digits. Exact rational certification is an extra computation, not a claim of
streaming with unbounded precision.

Reusable producers, fixtures and histories live in the canonical C++ library.
Captured records own their values and do not come from a separate report replay.
Selected counters and record/scalar policies are specified at their API
boundaries; they are not peak-byte or wall-time budgets. Synthetic structural
inputs are controlled fixtures for these mechanisms.

> References

- [Sale (1968), The calculation of e to many significant digits|https://doi.org/10.1093/comjnl/11.2.229]

